A second integrity failure is confirmed: tasks 12 and 5–8 created users/products around 01:47–02:29 site, roughly 14 hours before their assigned afternoon phase, and omitted them from the authoritative TSV registry. I’m recording one shared blocker, backfilling only the exact proven registry identities for teardown safety, and parking those cards without deleting or recreating fixtures.
